From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tu Dinh <ngoc-tu.dinh@vates.tech>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 11:29:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add IPv4 DNS setting for VIF configuration

